  "card": "Reduces per-block allocation overhead in CoinsViewOverlay during parallel prevout prefetching. It reuses the intra-block transaction ID hash set and worker task vector across blocks, omits the block's final transaction ID from the filter, and caps dispatched worker tasks to the queued input count. The author reports a 1% validation speedup, though benchmark numbers and environment details are not provided.",
